com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076330/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.poster.avif?t=1759410826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076330/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.webm?t=1759410826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076330/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.mp4?t=1759410826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Skill System</strong>: Discover and master more than 100 character skills, allowing for limitless build combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes and Weapons</strong>: Choose from a wide array of heroes and weaponry, each offering unique abilities and playstyles to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Management</strong>: Engage in a deep meta-game between battles. Build and upgrade your tower to gain passive bonuses, unlock new content, and strengthen your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Sessions</strong>: Experience intense action in 20-minute runs designed for quick yet satisfying gameplay sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Enhancement</strong>: Benefit from a passive progression system where each run contributes to your overall power, encouraging continual growth and new tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076330/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.poster.avif?t=1759410826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076330/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f7